{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672410/extras/8a5a1cb096a972bb67ee6b6549622672.avif?t=1756273078\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672410/extras_big/8a5a1cb096a972bb67ee6b6549622672.avif?t=1756273078 width=800 height=83 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop into the night sky of a futuristic city and take control of the arena!   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your Pogo Gear and conquer the field in a fast-paced, rhythm-meets-strategy battle.<br>Move to the beat, outsmart your rivals, and experience a whole new kind of action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672410/extras/9dc710cdaf56ea1bfe03c6e0266db851.poster.avif?t=1756273078\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672410/extras/9dc710cdaf56ea1bfe03c6e0266db851.webm?t=1756273078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672410/extras/9dc710cdaf56ea1bfe03c6e0266db851.mp4?t=1756273078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672410/extras/5e87b9b7be3ce5be03b3e001c5356fa3.avif?t=1756273078\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672410/extras_big/5e87b9b7be3ce5be03b3e001c5356fa3.avif?t=1756273078 width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze the field\u2019s structure, cut off key zones, and transform them into your territory.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the energy you gain to unleash powerful attacks!  <br>But be warned, every jump, every move, counts.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miss your timing, and you might find yourself backed into a corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672410/extras/2ff06ba1e3f2a36da1d5b384e87236fa.poster.avif?t=1756273078\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672410/extras/2ff06ba1e3f2a36da1d5b384e87236fa.webm?t=1756273078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672410/extras/2ff06ba1e3f2a36da1d5b384e87236fa.mp4?t=1756273078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672410/extras/0398537dc429fb7431226304c557983e.avif?t=1756273078\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672410/extras_big/0398537dc429fb7431226304c557983e.avif?t=1756273078 width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself through 9 themed areas with 45 increasingly tricky stages.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against mysterious foes, unravel strange disturbances, and master your rhythm and tactics.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only those who think fast and move faster will uncover what lies beyond...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672410/extras/83b80e5ba1267ddb4c282d96ff51a323.poster.avif?t=1756273078\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672410/extras/83b80e5ba1267ddb4c282d96ff51a323.webm?t=1756273078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9